<p>Hi <%= @sub_agent.display_name %>,</p>
<p>We couldn't approve your KYC submission for the following reason:</p>
<p><strong><%= @sub_agent.kyc_rejection_reason %></strong></p>
<% if @ambassador %>
<p>Please <a href="<%= @login_url %>">log in</a> to the Drwise platform, update your KYC details and submit again, and we'll review them again.</p>
<% else %>
<p>Please re-upload your Aadhaar and PAN documents in the app and we'll review them again.</p>
<% end %>
